:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the Enemy Unit, see [[Happy 100 (Enemy)]].''
'''Happy 100''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was introduced in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]] and can be obtained by logging in during the [[Crash Fever Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 328
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Happy 100
|name2 = Heartful Happy 100
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Heartful Happy 100''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
With low health and attack power and not enough range to be anything special, this unit is easily replaceable if you have progressed through [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1. Don't bother trying to use her past then.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump}}

